{"seq":1,"slug":"monolith-vs-microservices","title":"单体与微服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/architecture-patterns/monolith-vs-microservices","wordCount":1015,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"单体与微服务\">单体与微服务</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单体与微服务不是「落后 vs 先进」，而是两种适用于不同阶段的架构形态——核心差异在于部署单元的粒度与数据的所有权。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单体架构</strong>：所有模块打包在一个部署单元、共享进程与数据库；开发调试简单、事务一致性好，但部署耦合、扩展受限、技术栈锁定。</li>\n<li><strong>微服务架构</strong>：按业务能力拆分为独立部署的小服务，每个服务独立数据存储；核心价值是独立部署与独立扩展。</li>\n<li><strong>微服务五原则</strong>：单一职责、独立部署、数据自治、技术异构、容错设计。</li>\n<li><strong>服务间通信</strong>：同步（REST/gRPC）简单直接但耦合，异步（消息队列）松耦合但引入最终一致性。</li>\n<li><strong>演进路径</strong>：单体 → 模块化单体 → 服务化单体 → 微服务 → Service Mesh；&quot;先单体，后微服务&quot;是被广泛验证的路径。</li>\n<li><strong>拆分信号</strong>：部署需要多团队协调、某模块需要 10x 算力、团队超过 15–20 人、技术栈受限、非核心模块导致核心不可用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"单体架构\">单体架构</h2><p>单体架构（Monolith）将应用的所有功能模块打包在一个部署单元中。所有代码共享同一个进程、同一个数据库、同一个部署管道。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Client[客户端] --&gt; LB[负载均衡器]&#10;    LB --&gt; M1[单体应用实例 1]&#10;    LB --&gt; M2[单体应用实例 2]&#10;&#10;    subgraph M1[单体应用]&#10;        Auth[认证模块]&#10;        User[用户模块]&#10;        Order[订单模块]&#10;        Payment[支付模块]&#10;        Notification[通知模块]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    M1 --&gt; DB[(共享数据库)]&#10;    M2 --&gt; DB\">flowchart TB\n    Client[客户端] --&gt; LB[负载均衡器]\n    LB --&gt; M1[单体应用实例 1]\n    LB --&gt; M2[单体应用实例 2]\n\n    subgraph M1[单体应用]\n        Auth[认证模块]\n        User[用户模块]\n        Order[订单模块]\n        Payment[支付模块]\n        Notification[通知模块]\n    end\n\n    M1 --&gt; DB[(共享数据库)]\n    M2 --&gt; DB</pre><h3 id=\"单体的优势\">单体的优势</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const MONOLITH_ADVANTAGES = {&#10;  simpleDevelopment: &#39;所有代码在一个仓库，IDE 直接导航和重构&#39;,&#10;  easyDebugging: &#39;单进程调试，调用链清晰&#39;,&#10;  simpleDeployment: &#39;一个制品、一次部署&#39;,&#10;  noNetworkOverhead: &#39;模块间调用是函数调用，没有网络延迟&#39;,&#10;  transactionSimple: &#39;数据库事务直接保证一致性&#39;,&#10;  teamAlignment: &#39;小团队高效协作，无需跨服务沟通&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MONOLITH_ADVANTAGES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  simpleDevelopment: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'所有代码在一个仓库，IDE 直接导航和重构'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  easyDebugging: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'单进程调试，调用链清晰'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  simpleDeployment: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'一个制品、一次部署'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  noNetworkOverhead: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'模块间调用是函数调用，没有网络延迟'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transactionSimple: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据库事务直接保证一致性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  teamAlignment: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'小团队高效协作，无需跨服务沟通'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"单体的痛点\">单体的痛点</h3><p>随着系统规模增长，单体架构会逐渐暴露问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署耦合</td>\n<td>修改任何模块都需要重新部署整个应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展受限</td>\n<td>无法独立扩展高负载模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈锁定</td>\n<td>所有模块必须使用相同的语言和框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动时间</td>\n<td>应用体积增大，启动时间越来越长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性风险</td>\n<td>一个模块的内存泄漏可能导致整个应用崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队瓶颈</td>\n<td>代码冲突频繁，发布需要多团队协调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"微服务架构\">微服务架构</h2><p>微服务架构将应用拆分为多个独立部署的小服务，每个服务围绕一个业务能力构建，拥有自己的数据存储和部署管道。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Client[客户端] --&gt; Gateway[API 网关]&#10;    Gateway --&gt; AuthSvc[认证服务]&#10;    Gateway --&gt; UserSvc[用户服务]&#10;    Gateway --&gt; OrderSvc[订单服务]&#10;    Gateway --&gt; PaymentSvc[支付服务]&#10;    Gateway --&gt; NotifySvc[通知服务]&#10;&#10;    AuthSvc --&gt; AuthDB[(Auth DB)]&#10;    UserSvc --&gt; UserDB[(User DB)]&#10;    OrderSvc --&gt; OrderDB[(Order DB)]&#10;    PaymentSvc --&gt; PaymentDB[(Payment DB)]&#10;&#10;    OrderSvc --&gt; MQ[消息队列]&#10;    MQ --&gt; PaymentSvc&#10;    MQ --&gt; NotifySvc\">flowchart TB\n    Client[客户端] --&gt; Gateway[API 网关]\n    Gateway --&gt; AuthSvc[认证服务]\n    Gateway --&gt; UserSvc[用户服务]\n    Gateway --&gt; OrderSvc[订单服务]\n    Gateway --&gt; PaymentSvc[支付服务]\n    Gateway --&gt; NotifySvc[通知服务]\n\n    AuthSvc --&gt; AuthDB[(Auth DB)]\n    UserSvc --&gt; UserDB[(User DB)]\n    OrderSvc --&gt; OrderDB[(Order DB)]\n    PaymentSvc --&gt; PaymentDB[(Payment DB)]\n\n    OrderSvc --&gt; MQ[消息队列]\n    MQ --&gt; PaymentSvc\n    MQ --&gt; NotifySvc</pre><h3 id=\"微服务的核心原则\">微服务的核心原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一职责</td>\n<td>每个服务围绕一个业务能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立部署</td>\n<td>修改一个服务不需要重新部署其他服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据自治</td>\n<td>每个服务拥有自己的数据存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术异构</td>\n<td>每个服务可以使用最合适的技术栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错设计</td>\n<td>一个服务故障不应导致整个系统不可用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"服务间通信\">服务间通信</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 同步通信&#10;        S1[服务 A] --&gt;|REST / gRPC| S2[服务 B]&#10;        S2 --&gt;|响应| S1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 异步通信&#10;        S3[服务 C] --&gt;|发布事件| MQ[消息队列]&#10;        MQ --&gt;|消费事件| S4[服务 D]&#10;        MQ --&gt;|消费事件| S5[服务 E]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 同步通信\n        S1[服务 A] --&gt;|REST / gRPC| S2[服务 B]\n        S2 --&gt;|响应| S1\n    end\n    subgraph 异步通信\n        S3[服务 C] --&gt;|发布事件| MQ[消息队列]\n        MQ --&gt;|消费事件| S4[服务 D]\n        MQ --&gt;|消费事件| S5[服务 E]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ServiceRegistry {&#10;  register(name: string, address: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  discover(name: string): Promise&lt;string[]&gt;;&#10;  deregister(name: string, address: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class HttpServiceClient {&#10;  private registry: ServiceRegistry;&#10;&#10;  constructor(registry: ServiceRegistry) {&#10;    this.registry = registry;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async call&lt;T&gt;(serviceName: string, path: string): Promise&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    const instances = await this.registry.discover(serviceName);&#10;    if (instances.length === 0) {&#10;      throw new Error(`No instances available for ${serviceName}`);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const instance = instances[Math.floor(Math.random() * instances.length)];&#10;    const response = await fetch(`${instance}${path}`);&#10;&#10;    if (!response.ok) {&#10;      throw new Error(`Service call failed: ${response.status}`);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return response.json() as Promise&lt;T&gt;;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServiceRegistry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  discover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  deregister</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HttpServiceClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> registry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServiceRegistry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">registry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServiceRegistry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.registry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">serviceName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">discover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(serviceName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (instances.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`No instances available for ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">serviceName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances[Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response.ok) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Service call failed: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"全面对比\">全面对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单体架构</th>\n<th>微服务架构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>简单（一个制品）</td>\n<td>复杂（多个服务）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>整体扩展</td>\n<td>独立扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术多样性</td>\n<td>单一技术栈</td>\n<td>可混合技术栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据一致性</td>\n<td>简单（数据库事务）</td>\n<td>复杂（分布式事务）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队规模</td>\n<td>适合 &lt;20 人</td>\n<td>适合 &gt;20 人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障影响</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>局部（如果设计得当）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需要 K8s 等基础设施）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合阶段</td>\n<td>早期/验证阶段</td>\n<td>成熟/规模化阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"演进路径\">演进路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[单体] --&gt; B[模块化单体]&#10;    B --&gt; C[服务化单体&lt;br/&gt;内部 API 边界]&#10;    C --&gt; D[微服务&lt;br/&gt;独立部署]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Service Mesh&lt;br/&gt;基础设施层面管理]\">flowchart LR\n    A[单体] --&gt; B[模块化单体]\n    B --&gt; C[服务化单体&lt;br/&gt;内部 API 边界]\n    C --&gt; D[微服务&lt;br/&gt;独立部署]\n    D --&gt; E[Service Mesh&lt;br/&gt;基础设施层面管理]</pre><p>Amazon 的演进经验特别有代表性：2001 年的 Amazon 是一个庞大的单体应用，随着团队和业务的增长，逐步拆分为独立的服务。Jeff Bezos 著名的&quot;API Mandate&quot;要求所有团队通过 API 暴露功能、不允许直接访问其他团队的数据库——这个决定奠定了 Amazon 微服务架构的基础，也间接催生了 AWS。</p>\n<h3 id=\"何时该拆分\">何时该拆分</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const SPLIT_SIGNALS = {&#10;  deploymentPain: &#39;每次部署需要多个团队协调，发布周期越来越长&#39;,&#10;  scaleBottleneck: &#39;某个模块需要 10x 算力但只能整体扩展&#39;,&#10;  teamGrowth: &#39;团队超过 15-20 人，代码冲突严重&#39;,&#10;  techDebt: &#39;想引入新技术但被现有框架限制&#39;,&#10;  reliabilityIssue: &#39;非核心模块的 bug 导致核心服务不可用&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const DONT_SPLIT_SIGNALS = {&#10;  earlyStage: &#39;产品还在寻找 PMF，需求变化快&#39;,&#10;  smallTeam: &#39;团队不到 10 人&#39;,&#10;  noOperationalMaturity: &#39;没有容器化、CI/CD、监控等基础设施&#39;,&#10;  domainUnclear: &#39;业务边界不清晰，不知道怎么拆&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SPLIT_SIGNALS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deploymentPain: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每次部署需要多个团队协调，发布周期越来越长'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scaleBottleneck: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'某个模块需要 10x 算力但只能整体扩展'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  teamGrowth: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'团队超过 15-20 人，代码冲突严重'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  techDebt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'想引入新技术但被现有框架限制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reliabilityIssue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'非核心模块的 bug 导致核心服务不可用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DONT_SPLIT_SIGNALS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  earlyStage: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'产品还在寻找 PMF，需求变化快'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  smallTeam: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'团队不到 10 人'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  noOperationalMaturity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'没有容器化、CI/CD、监控等基础设施'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  domainUnclear: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'业务边界不清晰，不知道怎么拆'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((单体 vs 微服务))&#10;    单体&#10;      简单直接&#10;      适合小团队&#10;      早期验证&#10;      部署和调试容易&#10;    微服务&#10;      独立部署&#10;      独立扩展&#10;      技术异构&#10;      需要成熟基础设施&#10;    演进&#10;      不要一开始就微服务&#10;      模块化单体是好的起点&#10;      按业务边界拆分&#10;      先拆最痛的模块\">mindmap\n  root((单体 vs 微服务))\n    单体\n      简单直接\n      适合小团队\n      早期验证\n      部署和调试容易\n    微服务\n      独立部署\n      独立扩展\n      技术异构\n      需要成熟基础设施\n    演进\n      不要一开始就微服务\n      模块化单体是好的起点\n      按业务边界拆分\n      先拆最痛的模块</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>单体不是反模式</strong>——对于小团队和早期产品，单体是最高效的选择。</li>\n<li>微服务的核心价值是<strong>独立部署和独立扩展</strong>，但代价是分布式系统的复杂性。</li>\n<li>&quot;先单体，后微服务&quot;是被广泛验证的演进路径。</li>\n<li>拆分的时机取决于<strong>团队规模、部署痛点和扩展需求</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单体与微服务","id":"单体与微服务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"单体架构","id":"单体架构"},{"level":3,"text":"单体的优势","id":"单体的优势"},{"level":3,"text":"单体的痛点","id":"单体的痛点"},{"level":2,"text":"微服务架构","id":"微服务架构"},{"level":3,"text":"微服务的核心原则","id":"微服务的核心原则"},{"level":3,"text":"服务间通信","id":"服务间通信"},{"level":2,"text":"全面对比","id":"全面对比"},{"level":2,"text":"演进路径","id":"演进路径"},{"level":3,"text":"何时该拆分","id":"何时该拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"共识与协调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/distributed-systems/consensus-and-coordination"},"next":{"title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/architecture-patterns/event-driven-architecture"}}